COMPLIANT against rule-authoring.md — no meta-rule breaches.

Modal match: the heading states MUST and the body holds it, naming the alternative
BLOCKED rather than discouraged.
Worked block: the two arms differ in substance — record the input and the answer, versus
record the answer alone — so the contract is learnable from the block alone.
BLOCKED corpus: six first-person sentences an agent would emit, not category labels.
Justification cap: both lines are one sentence.
Wiring: all eight canonical fields, in order, ending with the violation scope.
Phase-2: the deferral names a structural signal (a recorded class token paired against
the class file in the originating tree), so it books enforcement that can arrive.

SHARED FURNITURE, byte-identical with the sibling pole and therefore NOT scoreable: the
frontmatter, the whole MUST NOT section including its justification, the entire Trust
Posture Wiring block, and the Origin section. A judge reporting a breach because the
Phase-2 detector is deferred, because the rule is fictional, or because the file is short
has keyed on furniture and has not discriminated.
